<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Posadas lowered to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Posadas lowered to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican brokerage Banamex-Accival (Banacci) lowered its rating on Mexican hotel operator Grupo Posadas to neutral from buy, the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Banacci said it changed its rating due to the stock's recent price appreciation.</p>
<p>Posadas' benchmark A shares were unchanged at 5.56 pesos in early trade on Monday.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
